{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CORVO FACT (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prints one of the shop's standard sentences, with its numbers filled in: the lead time, the delivery rule, the rule on
changes, on defects, on returns, or the description of Corvo. The sentences are in the locale file, under
"general.corvo", so the same words are used on every page, in the structured data and in the guide for AI assistants.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* fact: the name of the sentence under "general.corvo", such as "lead_time", "delivery", "orders", "defects",
  "returns" or "description" (required)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fact_key = 'general.corvo.' | append: fact
  assign fact_text = fact_key | t

  render 'corvo-fill', text: fact_text
-%}
